you're a safe bet.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.580
But to Jen's point, like,
you learn the lay of the land

00:12:16.375 --> 00:12:18.375
so that you you're better
prepared to talk about your

00:12:18.375 --> 00:12:20.295
skills and and what
you have to offer.

00:12:20.295 --> 00:12:22.395
And and also to know
for where you fit in.

00:12:23.015 --> 00:12:23.515
Absolutely.

