from a place where you were

00:39:17.235 --> 00:39:19.315
really grounded in your own
values and what's really

00:39:19.315 --> 00:39:20.355
important to you.

00:39:20.355 --> 00:39:22.630
So I think that's
great starting point is really

00:39:22.630 --> 00:39:24.390
thinking about, like,
what do you want,

00:39:24.390 --> 00:39:26.870
and what's most important
to you, miss next step.

00:39:26.870 --> 00:39:29.270
And then the second piece that
I really like about this piece

00:39:29.270 --> 00:39:30.650
of advice is that

00:39:31.615 --> 00:39:33.055
And and there are
many other frameworks.

00:39:33.055 --> 00:39:34.015
