or mission and things like that.

00:40:00.520 --> 00:40:01.020
And,

00:40:01.800 --> 00:40:03.720
I think thinking of, you know,

00:40:03.720 --> 00:40:06.645
your career and your jobs
as steps along the way that's

00:40:06.645 --> 00:40:08.585
building like a larger
career portfolio,

00:40:09.365 --> 00:40:11.465
has been really
useful for me. So

00:40:12.405 --> 00:40:15.280
I think you need to think about
what are your non like one of

00:40:15.280 --> 00:40:16.740
them for me is is culture.

00:40:17.760 --> 00:40:18.260
